    <DataNode elementId="CH33ADO" textLabel="5&apos;-deoxyadenosine" type="Metabolite">
      <Xref identifier="XGYIMTFOTBMPFP-KQYNXXCUSA-N" dataSource="InChIKey" />
      <Graphics centerX="227.84349060058594" centerY="576.1119995117188" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="xue, PMN, nilo-poyanco">|FRAME: CH33ADO &quot;5&apos;-Deoxyadenosine&quot;| is a common byproduct of |FRAME: Radical-AdoMet-Enzymes &quot;radical-&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;-adenosyl-L-methionine-dependent enzymes&quot;|. Since it acts as an inhibitor of radical SAM enzymes, pathways for its removal must be present in an organism.</Comment>
